
==== (a) s = i + j ====
  constraints after substitution  (vars: s j )
    s - j - 1 >= 0
    -s + j + 29 >= 0
    -s + 2*j - 2 >= 0
    -s + 39 >= 0
  bounds (Algorithm 11.13):
    L_s:  4
    U_s:  39
    L_j:  ceil_div(s + 2, 2)
    U_j:  s - 1
  generated code:
for (s = 4; s <= 39; s++)
  for (j = ceil_div(s + 2, 2); j <= s - 1; j++)
    X[s-j][j] = 0;
  verify (a) s = i + j: 342 iterations, IDENTICAL point set to brute force (no duplicates)
  first iterations in generated order: [1,3] [1,4] [2,4] [1,5] [2,5] [1,6] [3,5] [2,6] [1,7] [3,6] ...

==== (b) s = i + j ====
  constraints after substitution  (vars: s j )
    s - j - 10 >= 0
    -s + j + 1000 >= 0
    -s + 2*j >= 0
    s - 2*j + 9 >= 0
  bounds (Algorithm 11.13):
    L_s:  20
    U_s:  2009
    L_j:  s - 1000  ceil_div(s, 2)
    U_j:  s - 10  floor_div(s + 9, 2)
  generated code:
for (s = 20; s <= 2009; s++)
  for (j = max(s - 1000, ceil_div(s, 2)); j <= min(s - 10, floor_div(s + 9, 2)); j++)
    X[s-j][j] = 0;
  verify (b) s = i + j: 9910 iterations, IDENTICAL point set to brute force (no duplicates)
  first iterations in generated order: [10,10] [10,11] [11,11] [10,12] [11,12] [10,13] [12,12] [11,13] [10,14] [12,13] ...

==== (c) s = i + j ====
  constraints after substitution  (vars: s j k )
    s - j >= 0
    -s + j + 99 >= 0
    j >= 0
    s - 2*j + 99 >= 0
    -s + k >= 0
    -s - k + 99 >= 0
  bounds (Algorithm 11.13):
    L_s:  0
    U_s:  49
    L_j:  0
    U_j:  s
    L_k:  s
    U_k:  -s + 99
  generated code:
for (s = 0; s <= 49; s++)
